msgid "Abholorte"
msgstr "Pickup points"

#: delivery/pages.py:213
msgid ""
"Ein Netz von Punkten für bequeme Abholung und Abgabe — in deiner Nähe und zu"
" flexiblen Zeiten."
msgstr ""
"A network of points for convenient pickup and drop-off — near you and at "
"flexible times."

#: delivery/pages.py:215
msgid "Bequem und flexibel"
msgstr "Convenient and flexible"

#: delivery/pages.py:217
msgid "In deiner Nähe"
msgstr "Near you"

#: delivery/pages.py:217
msgid "Punkte über die ganze Stadt verteilt, immer in Reichweite."
msgstr "Points spread across the city, always within reach."

#: delivery/pages.py:218
msgid "Flexible Zeiten"
msgstr "Flexible times"

#: delivery/pages.py:218
msgid "Gib ab oder hol ab, wann es dir passt."
msgstr "Drop off or pick up whenever it suits you."

#: delivery/pages.py:219
msgid "Sichere Übergabe"
msgstr "Secure handover"

#: delivery/pages.py:219
msgid "Deine Sendung wartet sicher bis zur Abholung."
msgstr "Your shipment waits securely until pickup."

#: delivery/pages.py:221
msgid "Punkt in der Nähe finden"
msgstr "Find a point nearby"

#: delivery/pages.py:222
msgid "Öffne die App, um den nächstgelegenen Abholort zu sehen."
msgstr "Open the app to see the nearest pickup point."

